      "canonical_claim": "Under the current working value, each Squirrel body unit adds 10 optional slots to one shared, party-wide Strained Inventory in addition to ordinary secured Carry. Normal secured Carry remains governed by the ordinary party rule. Mixed parties gain this Strained capacity only from actual Squirrel body units; Guests add none unless their own species trait later provides otherwise. The shared Strained load is exposed to hidden lane-based Jostle checks, and both 10 slots per Squirrel and the 50% full-load ceiling remain tunable working values.",
