      "canonical_claim": "At each highway lane crossed, the system performs one hidden Jostle check per Squirrel body unit. Under the current working coefficient, each check's probability is 50% multiplied by current Strained Cargo divided by maximum Strained capacity. Thus a full inventory begins at 50% regardless of whether its maximum is 10, 20, or 30, a half-full inventory checks at 25%, and the procedure ceases when the inventory is empty.",
